title Table
align center
col
  w 100%
  maxw 720
  pad 20
  gap 12
  fnt 22
  fg 235 240 255
  txt Languages in this repository
  fnt 14
  fg 190 205 230
  tbl
    txt Name | Runs as | Style
    txt Emit | WebAssembly | typed, braces
    txt Mote | bytecode VM | Lua-like
    txt Opcode | WebAssembly | comma and full stop
    txt Spark | JavaScript | numbered lines
    txt Tiny | WebAssembly | three-letter words
    txt thirteen | interpreter | thirteen words
  end
  fnt 12
  fg 120 140 170
  txt Each row of a table is one txt line, with | between the cells.
  fnt 14
  lnk Back to the start page home
end
